<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE PROGRESS, EVERY DAY</view>
  <view class="row"><view class="heading">你好，{{user.name || '学习者'}} ✳</view><button class="primary small" bindtap="add">＋ 收录</button></view>
  <view class="subtitle">把每一次错误，变成下一次进步的起点。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在整理你的学习空间…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary small retry" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card" style="margin-top:25rpx"><view class="panel-title">整页作业，只收录确认的错题</view><view class="panel-note">识别印刷题与手写作答，辅助判题后逐题勾选。</view><button class="primary submit" bindtap="add">拍作业 · 检查错题 →</button></view><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">积少成多，循序渐进</view><view class="hero-title">今天的错题，<view>是明天的<text>加分项。</text></view></view><view class="subtitle">不必急着完美，每次多掌握一点就好。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="review">开始今日复习 →</button><view class="hero-note">{{stats.pending}} 道错题待巩固 · 从一道题开始</view><view class="hero-badge">✓</view></view>
    <view class="stats"><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">累计收录</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.total}}<text>道</text></view><view class="stat-note">每道错题，都是成长的线索</view></view><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">已掌握错题</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.mastered}}<text>道</text></view><view class="stat-note">{{stats.percent}}% 的知识已稳稳掌握</view></view><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">今日练习</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.todayCount}}<text>道</text></view><view class="stat-note">温故知新，每次多理解一点</view></view><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">连续学习</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.streak}}<text>天</text></view><view class="stat-note">保持好奇，持续生长</view></view></view>
    <view class="row"><view class="section-title">最近收录</view><view class="section-link" bindtap="all">全部错题 ↗</view></view>
    <view wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="id" class="card q-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><view class="subject-icon">{{item.subject}}</view><view class="q-info"><view class="row"><view class="q-title">{{item.title}}</view><text class="status {{item.mastered ? 'done' : ''}}">{{item.mastered ? '已掌握' : '待巩固'}}</text></view><view class="q-content">{{item.content}}</view><view class="q-meta"><text class="tag">{{item.subject}}</text><text>{{item.topic}}</text><text>· {{item.difficulty}}</text></view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{!recent.length}}" class="card empty">还没有错题，收录第一道吧。</view>
    <view class="card"><view class="panel-title">哪里薄弱，就从哪里突破。</view><view class="panel-note">按学科和难度组题，让每一次练习都有的放矢。</view><button class="primary submit" bindtap="generate">生成专属练习 ↗</button></view>
  </block>
  <view class="footnote">拾知 · 让知识真正属于你</view>
</view>
